==Description==
The '''Halloween Crate''' is a crate that could have been bought for {{Coins|4,000}} as part of the [[Lunar Overture Event]]. This crate yields twelve Halloween-themed skins, with some of them being old skins taken from previous Halloween events and crates. 

This crate has two rarities, {{Color|Event}} and {{Color|Exclusive}}. Both of these cost the same amount of coins in the store, that being {{Coins|5,000}}. However, despite both rarities having the same cost, {{Color|Event}} skins have a much lower chance to be unlocked than the {{Color|Exclusive}} skins.

The '''Halloween Crate''' is a black and orange striped chest with two wings on the side. A pumpkin lock can be found on the chest, which is used to open the crate with a golden heart key.

